{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"如何鼓励孩子去勇敢面对自己的不足？

有时候，ta缺乏信心。总自责自己做的还是不够好，距离标准答案太远了，直接不想做。可是，错只是说明在体验成长，是勇敢的表现，这是变强大的日常。结果越怕出错越出错。而且，ta感觉自己只会按照同样的方式处理不同的事情，常常担心自己很刻板。

有时候，ta总是嘴硬。ta会无限的合理化自己犯的错误，哪怕已经圆得非常不合理了，还要继续圆，且长期坚持自己的低级自洽的说法，不高兴别人提起这件事，尤其不接受别人说他做得不对。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"quote","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"作为父母，有一个诀窍，那就是一旦发现孩子身上有什么问题，第一时间不要想着孩子有什么需要改进的地方，而要思考自己身上有什么需要改进的地方。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"不要先去想孩子应该怎么办、应该怎么改变，而是要去想自己应该什么地方做得不同，怎么改变。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"然后用自己的改变去导致、触发孩子的改变。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"孩子就像一块烧熔的玻璃，而父母、学校、同学、亲友就像玻璃的印模，玻璃的形状实际上是跟着印模来的，而且这其中父母是最大的一块。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以解决问题的思路一定是“我的言行中有什么地方不太注意，以至于让ta有了如此坚定的错误认识”。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我做了什么，说了什么，漫不经心的让你因为坦承错误而受伤了，而我自己却没有发现。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是不是屡屡错过了肯定你直面错误的勇气的机会，对这种英勇熟视无睹，以至于你为此勇敢承担的内心惶恐没有得到任何回应？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是不是因为你屡屡未能克服你主动承认的困难而骂你愚蠢，甚至责备你逃避、软弱，以至于你绝望的发现还不如一开始就坚决不承认，把这番折磨掐死在萌芽之中？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我是不是曾经无意中附和那些嘲笑你的同学的说法，试图用“健康的羞耻感”刺激你努力——或者不如更诚实地说——恶意的报复你给我带来羞耻的“罪行”？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我要深深的搜索我的记忆，并请你帮我回忆，因为我可能为了逃避我的错误而不自觉地自我欺骗。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我的孩子，你看，我要认这个错有多不容易——如果不是看到你的反应，我根本不会意识到我已经错过了这么多；如果没有你的帮助，我甚至回忆不起、无法承认我做过这些。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我现在真诚的向你道歉，你会这样害怕面对错误，我有责任。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"那么，我的孩子，你现在因此而看不起我了吗？你会嘲笑我吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你发现了吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"其实你没有。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而纵使你嘲笑我、鄙视我，请相信我，我会做的和现在也不会有什么不同。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为比起受嘲笑、受鄙视，我更关心我这样改变，能不能帮助到你。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我会尝试改正这些言行，但你会看到的，这些错误并不容易改掉，我也需要你一次又一次的提醒我，我也只能一次又一次的尝试。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你会因为我这么笨、这么屡教不改而嘲笑我，鄙视我吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"这个到后面我屡屡犯错被提醒时，我们再验证吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我的孩子，你知道人生最大的难关是什么吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"最大的难关不是解决问题、不是表现完美、不是无懈可击，而恰恰就是认错本身。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你会发现，人生千千万万的课题，不管是英语、数学，还是卖东西、工作、谈恋爱，都是在不断的考验人认错的功夫和技术。是的，“认错”本身就是一个专业，是一个技能，是一种功夫。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是一种神通，一种修炼好了能让人敬畏的神力。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"它是很不好练的，但把它练好了，这个世界上就没有什么是你绝对无法企及的。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，千千万万不要因为我的愚蠢而拒绝和抛弃这门最重要的修炼。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"那么，我的孩子，你看到我因为这次认错而受辱、受损了吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"所以，并不是所有主动的认错都会受辱、受损的，对吗？即使是一时根本改不好的那种，也不会仅仅因为承认而成为灾难。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"是吗？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"为什么我没有受到折磨？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"因为你爱我，胜过了我爱你。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你给我的是孩子对父母的纯真的爱，我一点也不怀疑。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"而我给你的却是我在世上沉浮，因为沾染了无数焦虑、恐惧、傲慢后磨损了的爱。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你此刻对我的宽容，其实胜过了我平时对你的宽容。所以我对你可以这么大胆的认错而不害怕，而你对我认错，我却常给你不该有的残忍。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我要向你学习，是我错了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我还可能再犯，那时候你再提醒我吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"希望我刚才做的这些，能让你对认错这件事不再那么顾虑。但就像我刚才说的，这是一门盖世神功，练成了无坚不摧，所以我们也不能指望看一看就突然练成了。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我们慢慢来吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"我给你做十个俯卧撑，向你道歉。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"下次再犯，再做十个。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"type":"horizontalrule","version":1},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"记住，你只能通过改变自己去推动孩子的改变，别问孩子应该怎么改正，要问自己应该怎么改正。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"自己体会吧。","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}
